Use exact decimal-safe calculations for financial values.

Dashboard formulas:

Total expenses = sum of valid recorded expense amounts in the selected date range.

Total income = sum of valid recorded income amounts in the selected date range.

Recorded difference = recorded income minus recorded expenses.

Crop-level recorded difference = linked crop-cycle income minus linked crop-cycle expenses.

Always use explicit date-range rules and include dates in reports.

Do not label the recorded difference as guaranteed net profit. Excluded or unrecorded costs may change the actual result.

Do not count uncompleted or failed operations in report totals.

